Credentials exposed                         impact       high    Secrets, keys, certificates or stored passwords were read. Treat them as known to the attacker.
Movement to other systems                   impact       high    Tools that reach other systems were run. Hosts beyond this one may be affected.
Commands generated by an AI agent           impact       medium  The scripts were written by an AI agent, which is the premise of this tool. Generated commands differ from run to run, so a detection that matches exact text misses them.
Environment mapped                          impact       low     Identities, resources or configuration were listed. Later steps were probably aimed with the result.
Revoke sessions and reset identities        remediation  high    Revoke the sessions and tokens of every identity in the evidence and reset its credentials.
Rotate what was read                        remediation  high    Rotate every secret, key and certificate that was read, and reset the accounts of any host whose credentials were dumped.
Follow what was enumerated                  remediation  low     Use what was listed to predict targets: check those identities, vaults and hosts for later activity.
M1015 Active Directory Configuration        mitigation   high    Implement robust Active Directory (AD) configurations using group policies to secure user accounts, control access, and minimize the attack surface.
M1041 Encrypt Sensitive Information         mitigation   high    Protect sensitive information at rest, in transit, and during processing by using strong encryption algorithms.
M1042 Disable or Remove Feature or Program  mitigation   high    Disable or remove unnecessary and potentially vulnerable software, features, or services to reduce the attack surface and prevent abuse by adversaries.
M1047 Audit                                 mitigation   high    Auditing is the process of recording activity and systematically reviewing and analyzing the activity and system configurations.
AML.M0020 Generative AI Guardrails          mitigation   medium  Guardrails are safety controls placed between users, tools, and generative AI models to evaluate prompts, retrieved context, model outputs, and agent actions before they are accepted, executed, or shown to a user.
AML.M0022 Generative AI Model Alignment     mitigation   medium  Generative AI Model Alignment is the process of training or fine-tuning a generative model to guide its output toward a set of human values, goals, or ethical principles.
